<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon cuts European oil stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon cuts European oil stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petrofina, Norsk Hydro, OMV and MOL were downgraded at Salomon Brothers on Thursday, a research note from oil and gas analysts at the investment bank said.</p>
<p>Petrofina and Norsk Hydro were cut to &quot;underperform,&quot; while OMV and MOL were cut to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;buy,&quot; analysts Gordon Gray and Jeremy Hudson said.</p>
<p>Salomon said it expected oil prices to slip in coming months and maintained an underweight stance on the sector as a whole.</p>
<p>It said the downgrades followed a strong recent performance by all four, which had stretched their valuations.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
